n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3 & =M\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{2})}^{4} \\\\ 3 & =M\\cdot (\\frac{{1}^{4}}{{2}^{4}}) \\\\ 3 & =M\\cdot \\frac{1}{16} \\\\ 3\\cdot 16 & =M \\\\ 48 & =M\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $M=48.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186546906 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1069 "q-218599" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1071 "If $f(x)=A\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{3})}^{x}$ and $f(4)=2,$ then $A=${{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7a913f31-a39a-5842-bec8-7be0ed73cc2a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547021 #edb/ref 1074 "We substitute $x=4$ and $f(x)=2$ into the expression for $f(x)$ and solve for $A,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & =A\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{3})}^{4} \\\\ 2 & =A\\cdot (\\frac{{1}^{4}}{{3}^{4}}) \\\\ 2 & =A\\cdot \\frac{1}{81} \\\\ 2\\cdot 81 & =A \\\\ 162 & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $A=162.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186546904 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1069 "q-112141" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1071 "The growth of a mice colony is given by the formula $M(t)=6\\cdot {2}^{t},$ where $t$ is the time, in months, since the beginning of the observation. How many mice will the colony have after $5$ months?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c55619be-bc04-5da4-9e98-241a09beba3a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547051 #edb/ref 1074 "To get the number of mice in the colony after $5$ months, we evaluate the function at $t=5.$ Substituting $t=5$ into the function $M(t)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M(5) & =6\\cdot {2}^{5} \\\\  & =6\\cdot 32 \\\\  & =192.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, after $5$ months there will be $192$ mice in the colony." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547099 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "24c4d8ea-2c2d-5bf1-8012-7f901ed738b4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547099 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186547021 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547106 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186547144 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547106 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "400b2935-82a5-5288-b8ed-ee8bd5f66ac6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547106 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186547010 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547144 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186547099 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547144 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b7c0f0f3-0bc3-52e8-9529-1d0edd9dbc37" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186547144 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186547051 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
